    "Cost": 8405547,
    "UIName": "Spirit 1",
    "Id": "mechdef_spirit_SPI-1",
    "Name": "Spirit 1",
    "Details": "Since the Spirit is primarily a reconnaissance 'Mech, it heavily relies on the use of energy weapons so that it can move far from supply lines. At long range, the Spirit makes use of its ER large laser and a LRM-10 launcher with an Artemis IV FCS accompanying it. The missile launcher is a somewhat controversial addition to the design, since it uses ammunition, but the extra striking power afforded the light 'Mech was deemed worthwhile. Up close, the Spirit mounts a heavy medium laser and heavy small laser, as well as a Streak SRM-4 launcher. Since the Streak launcher does not waste ammunition, there was no question of its usefulness on this design. 11 double heat sinks strain to keep the 'Mech cool under the energy heavy loadout.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Improved Jammer</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.06</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limit: Left Lower</color>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_spirit"
  },
